# Container scripts, patches and configs must stay LF even when Git for Windows
# checks out with core.autocrlf=true: CRLF breaks the shebang of the scripts
# copied into the image and makes git apply reject the DSH patches.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.bat text eol=crlf
*.cmd text eol=crlf
*.ps1 text eol=lf
*.sh text eol=lf
*.patch text eol=lf
